# WatchWindowTripwireControl (0x427b30), mode 2: Watch [40k, 80k, 120k], then the group resets.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
100 poke info_text_box message_field 2
110 event s_trip3 ControlCollision
120 event s_trip4 ControlCollision
